Historical DLI metadata only
============================

The exact b35 declarations/projection and original five bus tests are retained
for USB/UART/SPI/serdev historical regressions. They are not production
capabilities, a second backend, or a supported wire Host. Current registration
contains only bus/address/legacy version observation; actual capability data
comes from the existing Native snapshot, never an inferred MTU/security field.
The audit JSON is the creation-time scope; current qualification lives in the
userspace canonical registry. No fixture is built by the default kernel.
